/*
 * Rounded 6x10 console face: printable ASCII, real lowercase, soft bowls.
 *
 * The table is hand-authored ASCII art. Each row is a six-bit literal whose
 * bit 5 is the leftmost column, so the shape of a glyph is readable in source
 * without a separate font tool. It replaces InterfaceKit's 3x5 face on the
 * Linux framebuffer console; the two fonts serve different jobs.
 */
